WEBVTT

00:00:05.240 --> 00:00:07.010
We've been awaiting your arrival.

00:00:08.380 --> 00:00:09.560
Wow...

00:00:09.870 --> 00:00:12.550
This is some greeting.

00:00:17.880 --> 00:00:21.220
I am Dion, leader of the Knights of the Silver Tree.

00:02:00.250 --> 00:02:03.090
Phase 06: Visiting the Holy Capital

00:02:04.530 --> 00:02:06.030
You're in the way...

00:02:08.730 --> 00:02:12.850
Jeez, I'm not here to get your picture.

00:02:22.350 --> 00:02:23.680
There we go.

00:02:24.780 --> 00:02:26.870
My lovely little treasure...

00:02:30.660 --> 00:02:32.840
Is Hyuuga doing well?

00:02:34.040 --> 00:02:36.720
I've known him a long time.

00:02:36.780 --> 00:02:40.470
Oh that's right - you were both part of the Knights.

00:02:40.590 --> 00:02:43.900
Yes, we learned swordsmanship together.

00:02:44.260 --> 00:02:46.230
The number of times I must have fought him...

00:02:46.670 --> 00:02:48.520
Hyuuga is doing very well.

00:02:48.710 --> 00:02:51.540
He came here with us, but...

00:02:51.670 --> 00:02:53.490
He stayed outside, right?

00:02:53.670 --> 00:02:56.100
His personality hasn't changed.

00:02:56.160 --> 00:02:57.710
Really?

00:03:04.810 --> 00:03:08.930
Ever since the Aurora appeared, we've had more pilgrims visiting us.

00:03:09.400 --> 00:03:13.350
The hope that the Queen has been born is rising.

00:03:20.190 --> 00:03:22.890
I can't believe so many people are expecting so much from me...

00:03:27.580 --> 00:03:30.460
The Head of the Order awaits.

00:03:30.720 --> 00:03:32.670
Okay, I'll be back soon.

00:03:32.720 --> 00:03:33.720
All right.

00:03:34.070 --> 00:03:35.520
Don't worry.

00:03:35.900 --> 00:03:37.470
You'll be fine.

00:03:37.830 --> 00:03:39.040
It's okay.

00:03:39.290 --> 00:03:40.600
Do your best.

00:03:40.650 --> 00:03:44.590
I'm sure the meeting will go just fine, Mademoiselle.

00:03:59.930 --> 00:04:01.320
Let us go.

00:04:22.480 --> 00:04:25.350
The Head of the Order has come.

00:04:46.140 --> 00:04:49.130
Thank you for coming, Angelique.

00:04:51.070 --> 00:04:52.870
I am Angelique.

00:04:55.560 --> 00:04:58.570
This is the Head of the Order.

00:04:59.680 --> 00:05:02.210
Thank you, Dion.

00:05:02.400 --> 00:05:03.690
You may leave.

00:05:03.760 --> 00:05:04.780
Yes, sir.

00:05:07.760 --> 00:05:10.530
The Queen's Egg: Angelique.

00:05:10.780 --> 00:05:14.580
Word of your deeds has reached my ears.

00:05:14.700 --> 00:05:18.990
They're not just my deeds... I always receive help from others.

00:05:19.030 --> 00:05:21.160
There's no need to be modest.

00:05:21.600 --> 00:05:26.950
No, it's true. I don't really understand much, so I just deal with whatever is in front of me...

00:05:27.270 --> 00:05:30.960
Then, there was merit in calling you here.

00:05:31.900 --> 00:05:37.600
The reason I've called you here is to relay a message to you that has been passed down to me.

00:05:38.620 --> 00:05:46.350
Impressive... I suppose you get nice rooms when you're lackeys for the Queen's Egg.

00:05:47.340 --> 00:05:50.340
I don't remember ever becoming her lackey.

00:05:50.670 --> 00:05:52.860
By the way, where's Jade?

00:05:53.160 --> 00:05:55.800
He said he wanted to go for a walk outside.

00:05:56.150 --> 00:05:59.340
I suppose that's fine as long as he's back by the time Angelique returns.

00:05:59.420 --> 00:06:00.700
That's right.

00:06:02.050 --> 00:06:06.750
Angelique, the Thanatos are merely shadows.

00:06:06.900 --> 00:06:08.030
Shadows?

00:06:08.220 --> 00:06:13.560
Yes, shadows of the root that troubles Arcadia.

00:06:14.260 --> 00:06:16.370
And the name of this root is...

00:06:16.800 --> 00:06:17.720
Erbos.

00:06:18.140 --> 00:06:19.400
Erbos.

00:06:19.560 --> 00:06:24.480
We don't know much about its physical form, but we believe it to be an amalgam of evil thoughts and desires.

00:06:25.170 --> 00:06:33.830
Erbos was once sealed in another dimension, but one day, a rift formed, opening it.

00:06:34.780 --> 00:06:44.390
Erbos is sending its shadows, the Thanatos, through that rift and stealing life energy.

00:06:45.390 --> 00:06:52.080
At the moment, the damage is localized, but eventually, the world shall be destroyed.

00:06:53.990 --> 00:06:58.800
The Knights of the Silver Tree and the Orb Hunters are only capable of temporarily driving the Thanatos out;

00:06:58.800 --> 00:07:00.680
they cannot destroy them.

00:07:01.320 --> 00:07:05.950
Only the Queen can completely destroy them.

00:07:06.590 --> 00:07:11.010
Then, can the Queen destroy this Erbos?

00:07:12.200 --> 00:07:15.970
She could... if she had the power of the true Queen.

00:07:33.230 --> 00:07:34.330
You?

00:07:35.410 --> 00:07:37.240
You don't seem to be out of practice.

00:07:38.330 --> 00:07:39.560
Neither do you.

00:07:39.870 --> 00:07:42.290
You've come a long way.

00:07:42.500 --> 00:07:45.350
You should at least show your presence to the Head of the Order.

00:07:45.910 --> 00:07:47.250
That won't do.

00:07:48.300 --> 00:07:50.570
You're as stubborn as ever.

00:07:51.520 --> 00:07:54.560
You still have no desire to return to the Order?

00:07:56.060 --> 00:07:58.260
Nobody blames you.

00:07:58.400 --> 00:08:00.940
A man of your talents could...

00:08:01.040 --> 00:08:02.830
I do not.

00:08:06.650 --> 00:08:10.630
So you're still hurting about Carlyle...

00:08:12.150 --> 00:08:19.260
If the Queen has been born, that means people will no longer suffer in fear and can finally live in peace.

00:08:19.620 --> 00:08:20.620
Yes.

00:08:20.700 --> 00:08:24.260
You carry the hopes of a race.

00:08:24.610 --> 00:08:27.060
But I...

00:08:29.600 --> 00:08:34.380
I really don't know if I can satisfy their expectations...

00:08:48.190 --> 00:08:52.720
I never thought the Queen's Egg would be such a fragile girl.

00:08:57.970 --> 00:08:59.310
Angelique...

00:09:00.180 --> 00:09:01.710
Queen's Egg.

00:09:02.650 --> 00:09:08.360
Perhaps you still need molding softly, lest you break.

00:09:09.800 --> 00:09:12.650
But have faith!

00:09:12.800 --> 00:09:16.630
Know that the universe watches over you.

00:09:20.730 --> 00:09:25.360
I pray that, one day, you will break out from your shell and become the Queen.

00:09:25.610 --> 00:09:30.030
This is my prayer, and the Order's, and the world's.

00:09:30.650 --> 00:09:31.730
Yes!

00:09:31.960 --> 00:09:33.550
Thank you very much!

00:09:38.180 --> 00:09:42.820
I must to do my best to answer everyone's prayers.

00:09:43.930 --> 00:09:46.180
Thank you very much, Lady Angelique.

00:09:46.570 --> 00:09:48.410
We'll have to excuse ourselves.

00:09:48.830 --> 00:09:52.560
The rest of your party is awaiting your return in the rooms over there.

00:09:52.850 --> 00:09:54.490
Thank you very much.

00:09:58.940 --> 00:10:00.570
I was so nervous.

00:10:00.940 --> 00:10:03.640
I need to get back to everyone...

00:10:06.420 --> 00:10:08.290
What?

00:10:12.040 --> 00:10:15.130
How was the meeting, Queen's Egg?

00:10:15.290 --> 00:10:17.120
Y-You...

00:10:17.520 --> 00:10:19.670
Oh don't worry, I'm no one scary.

00:10:19.940 --> 00:10:21.700
My name's Rosh.

00:10:21.880 --> 00:10:23.940
I'm a journalist.

00:10:24.650 --> 00:10:26.200
A journalist?

00:10:26.280 --> 00:10:29.860
Yeah. Can I talk to you for a bit?

00:10:30.260 --> 00:10:32.810
You're the star of the show right now, aren't you?

00:10:33.840 --> 00:10:37.180
There are people waiting for me...

00:10:37.690 --> 00:10:39.480
Waiting for you?

00:10:39.760 --> 00:10:42.170
Oh, them?

00:10:43.270 --> 00:10:45.370
Let them wait.

00:10:45.800 --> 00:10:47.300
How rude!

00:10:47.690 --> 00:10:49.290
Excuse me.

00:10:51.570 --> 00:10:53.640
Don't be like that!

00:10:53.710 --> 00:10:56.770
We can chat over some tea or something if you like.

00:10:57.800 --> 00:11:01.720
You're cute when you're upset.

00:11:04.580 --> 00:11:07.160
Anyway, come on, help me out here.

00:11:07.200 --> 00:11:09.020
H-Hey...

00:11:12.970 --> 00:11:14.540
Hey, you!

00:11:14.660 --> 00:11:16.100
Watch where you're going!

00:11:16.150 --> 00:11:17.530
I'm sorry!

00:11:17.570 --> 00:11:18.980
We were blocking the middle of the street...

00:11:19.170 --> 00:11:23.560
How'd you get in here?

00:11:24.350 --> 00:11:27.500
From your clothing, you're definitely not a pilgrim.

00:11:28.700 --> 00:11:32.580
Sure would be bad if the Knights caught you!

00:11:34.050 --> 00:11:36.090
There they are!

00:11:41.850 --> 00:11:42.820
Come with me.

00:11:45.810 --> 00:11:46.660
Quickly!

00:11:46.770 --> 00:11:48.250
Wait!

00:11:48.340 --> 00:11:51.780
What? There's nobody here?

00:11:52.310 --> 00:11:53.520
No way...

00:11:55.510 --> 00:11:57.500
That guy!

00:11:57.740 --> 00:11:58.880
This way!

00:12:00.370 --> 00:12:02.150
What?

00:12:03.940 --> 00:12:05.590
What is this?

00:12:11.890 --> 00:12:13.530
She's late.

00:12:13.880 --> 00:12:17.020
You've no need to worry, Lein.

00:12:17.220 --> 00:12:18.470
That's right.

00:12:21.240 --> 00:12:23.560
Um, where are we going?

00:12:23.840 --> 00:12:26.050
He's following us.

00:12:28.100 --> 00:12:30.770
This is a scoop in itself!

00:12:30.820 --> 00:12:33.490
The man eloping with the Queen's Egg!

00:12:34.530 --> 00:12:36.200
But who is this man?

00:12:36.240 --> 00:12:39.440
Running around in the Holy Capital so carefree...

00:12:39.520 --> 00:12:42.010
Oh well, I'll get the scoop!

00:12:42.130 --> 00:12:43.960
Man, he's persistent.

00:12:44.000 --> 00:12:45.300
This way!

00:12:47.470 --> 00:12:48.510
Wait!

00:12:50.970 --> 00:12:51.840
Let's go!

00:12:54.490 --> 00:12:56.410
I'm not letting you get away!

00:12:56.500 --> 00:12:57.910
Where did you go?

00:12:59.100 --> 00:13:00.130
This way!

00:13:01.100 --> 00:13:03.200
What's with those guys?

00:13:06.190 --> 00:13:07.590
Wait!

00:13:07.910 --> 00:13:08.980
This way!

00:13:11.510 --> 00:13:12.880
This way!

00:13:14.100 --> 00:13:15.150
Damn...

00:13:15.670 --> 00:13:16.900
Wait!

00:13:19.180 --> 00:13:20.580
That's...

00:13:21.650 --> 00:13:24.490
Damn, I'll get you for that.

00:13:26.450 --> 00:13:27.840
What are you doing?

00:13:29.470 --> 00:13:31.890
This kid's weird...

00:13:31.980 --> 00:13:32.850
Come with me.

00:13:32.960 --> 00:13:34.930
Wait!

00:13:35.450 --> 00:13:36.720
You're the one who should be waiting!

00:13:36.750 --> 00:13:38.310
Let me go!

00:13:38.420 --> 00:13:40.390
Taking pictures without permission is illegal.

00:13:40.470 --> 00:13:41.780
We're confiscating your film.

00:13:42.940 --> 00:13:45.930
Curses! Wait!

00:13:46.520 --> 00:13:49.520
My treasure!

00:13:56.090 --> 00:13:58.380
Man, that surprised me.

00:13:58.570 --> 00:14:03.600
Thank you for saving me from that guy.

00:14:09.440 --> 00:14:11.280
It's so pretty.

00:14:11.360 --> 00:14:13.230
I've never seen anything so pretty!

00:14:13.510 --> 00:14:17.600
I'm Rune, a member of the Knights of the Silver Tree.

00:14:17.790 --> 00:14:20.030
I'm still an apprentice though.

00:14:20.610 --> 00:14:22.640
I'm Angelique.

00:14:22.730 --> 00:14:25.350
I know. You're the Queen's Egg, right?

00:14:25.650 --> 00:14:27.390
You came to meet Mathius...

00:14:27.540 --> 00:14:30.010
I mean, Sir Mathius...

00:14:30.110 --> 00:14:31.710
Sir Mathius?

00:14:31.800 --> 00:14:33.730
The person you just met.

00:14:33.790 --> 00:14:36.220
Oh, the Head of the Order.

00:14:39.240 --> 00:14:42.280
Do you live here, Rune?

00:14:42.550 --> 00:14:43.860
Yes, I do.

00:14:44.290 --> 00:14:46.600
It's a wonderful place.

00:14:48.710 --> 00:14:51.110
That's what it looks like to you...

00:14:53.700 --> 00:14:55.470
I know, Angelique!

00:14:55.540 --> 00:14:58.300
I'll take you to a secret place.

00:14:58.440 --> 00:15:00.070
Um...

00:15:04.780 --> 00:15:06.080
You're cute.

00:15:06.280 --> 00:15:08.910
We were holding hands all the time.

00:15:09.400 --> 00:15:10.870
What's this?

00:15:11.530 --> 00:15:16.330
But it's strange... it doesn't feel like we just met.

00:15:31.000 --> 00:15:32.860
A silver tree.

00:15:33.960 --> 00:15:35.920
It's my secret place.

00:15:36.290 --> 00:15:37.640
It's warm.

00:15:37.730 --> 00:15:40.050
There's no snow here?

00:15:40.140 --> 00:15:42.720
Nope, not even a flake all year round.

00:15:48.210 --> 00:15:49.560
What is it?

00:15:54.340 --> 00:15:56.630
I feel like the tree is calling to me...

00:16:07.110 --> 00:16:09.560
Um, Rune, what <i>is</i> this tree?

00:16:09.650 --> 00:16:12.340
It's called the Great Silver Tree.

00:16:13.090 --> 00:16:16.030
It's said to represent all life in Arcadia.

00:16:16.180 --> 00:16:20.550
While the world remains beautiful, this tree continues to sparkle...

00:16:21.330 --> 00:16:24.350
All life in Arcadia...

00:16:51.640 --> 00:16:54.770
This has never happened before...

00:16:59.530 --> 00:17:00.790
It's warm.

00:17:02.970 --> 00:17:06.660
A warm light is filling my heart...

00:17:12.470 --> 00:17:14.570
Looks like it's welcoming you.

00:17:16.330 --> 00:17:18.710
That would be wonderful.

00:17:19.540 --> 00:17:21.680
Hey, Angelique...

00:17:22.700 --> 00:17:26.460
It's said that the universe has a will of its own and that it chooses its Queen.

00:17:27.010 --> 00:17:31.110
If you become the Queen, you'll have to lead the world.

00:17:32.320 --> 00:17:35.400
There might be painful experiences to endure.

00:17:35.690 --> 00:17:38.770
Will you be able to endure them?

00:17:40.000 --> 00:17:44.710
It might be hard, but I'll do my best.

00:17:45.060 --> 00:17:48.620
I have people supporting me.

00:17:50.960 --> 00:17:52.070
I see...

00:17:53.460 --> 00:17:57.570
I'm a bird in a cage.

00:17:58.580 --> 00:18:02.780
But Angelique, you're...

00:18:09.660 --> 00:18:11.890
How many books have you read, Lein?

00:18:12.070 --> 00:18:13.800
This is the fourteenth one.

00:18:15.070 --> 00:18:17.250
And how many cups have you had?

00:18:17.350 --> 00:18:19.160
This is my twelfth.

00:18:20.260 --> 00:18:23.020
It may be time.

00:18:23.200 --> 00:18:24.220
Yes.

00:18:25.500 --> 00:18:26.610
Where's Jade?

00:18:35.510 --> 00:18:37.410
I have to get back...

00:18:56.620 --> 00:19:00.080
I must get back to her.

00:19:04.540 --> 00:19:06.340
What are you doing, Jade?

00:19:06.430 --> 00:19:08.170
Angelique's coming back.

00:19:08.290 --> 00:19:13.260
Yes, let's go see her.

00:19:16.500 --> 00:19:18.950
Sorry I'm late!

00:19:20.360 --> 00:19:21.560
No, it's fine.

00:19:21.630 --> 00:19:23.440
As long as you're back.

00:19:23.500 --> 00:19:25.950
Did you meet some nice people on your journey?

00:19:26.450 --> 00:19:27.410
I did.

00:19:27.590 --> 00:19:29.180
Who's that?

00:19:33.350 --> 00:19:34.940
The Head of the Order?

00:19:35.630 --> 00:19:37.380
That's the Head of the Order?

00:19:39.450 --> 00:19:41.780
Thank you for today.

00:19:41.900 --> 00:19:44.600
I was just about to head back.

00:19:44.690 --> 00:19:48.570
No, you must remain here in Celestizam.

00:19:50.260 --> 00:19:53.590
Your fate is proud and noble.

00:19:54.560 --> 00:19:57.480
There's no need for you to put yourself at risk.

00:19:58.130 --> 00:20:02.100
You should stay here under the protection of the Order until the time comes.

00:20:02.760 --> 00:20:07.790
My, my, you're going to keep this lovely flower all to yourself?

00:20:08.440 --> 00:20:10.170
That's a sin, I believe.

00:20:10.280 --> 00:20:12.100
I can't allow something like that.

00:20:13.490 --> 00:20:16.490
Could you please reconsider, Sir?

00:20:17.030 --> 00:20:19.160
She's an important companion of ours.

00:20:19.220 --> 00:20:21.630
We'll protect her.

00:20:21.700 --> 00:20:23.030
No matter what.

00:20:23.320 --> 00:20:24.500
Everyone...

00:20:27.030 --> 00:20:30.250
I want to be with everyone.

00:20:31.440 --> 00:20:34.250
Please forgive our rudeness, Sir.

00:20:34.790 --> 00:20:40.970
Until the day I become Queen, I want to answer the call of as many people as I can.

00:20:41.370 --> 00:20:45.020
I want to do my best with my companions at the Sunlit Mansion.

00:20:56.340 --> 00:20:58.290
So, you won't come back?

00:20:58.350 --> 00:20:59.070
No, I won't.

00:20:59.640 --> 00:21:00.990
I leave them in your hands.

00:21:01.060 --> 00:21:02.000
Yes.

00:21:02.080 --> 00:21:04.720
They're such a handful and as mischievous as ever.

00:21:10.860 --> 00:21:12.390
Hey, Mathius.

00:21:12.440 --> 00:21:13.210
Rune?

00:21:13.490 --> 00:21:16.370
She was the real thing, wasn't she?

00:21:16.850 --> 00:21:18.160
The real thing...

00:21:18.780 --> 00:21:20.120
I see.

00:21:22.600 --> 00:21:26.530
Someday, she'll return here.

00:21:27.230 --> 00:21:28.370
I know it.

00:21:31.530 --> 00:21:34.790
My cherished companions...

00:21:40.500 --> 00:21:41.960
You did well.

00:21:42.970 --> 00:21:47.020
It was an important journey, Angelique.

00:21:47.130 --> 00:21:50.050
Let's go home.

00:21:50.360 --> 00:21:51.390
Yes.

00:23:36.410 --> 00:23:38.550
Jade, wake up!

00:23:38.580 --> 00:23:41.170
Will she make it through this trial?

00:23:41.220 --> 00:23:42.100
Dunno.

00:23:42.130 --> 00:23:44.000
It wouldn't be any fun if you knew the ending, would it?

00:23:44.180 --> 00:23:46.320
Next time: Seed of Happiness

00:23:46.400 --> 00:23:47.950
You're the real thing.

00:23:48.070 --> 00:23:49.390
Show me a miracle.
